        "Title": "A Humble Request",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO_FLU",
        "PublicId": "118508057501",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_flu.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f19cb43e-7f33-4d27-aa42-ecd7918eb2fe).Image",
        "Description": "Hello Agent.\r\rI come to you to ask for one thing: Retribution.\r\rThe three targets were all in part responsible for the death of my wife and unborn child. Risae, unknowingly, caused a boiler explosion that sparked a fire. I&apos;d always wished she died in that explosion... Max was a firefighter that forgot his axe, rendering him unable to get to my family. Make sure he never forgets his axe again. Shoudai fled,  not looking back at my pleading wife. I want him burned, 47.",
